# A keyboard layout for the remote (see VolumeSlider). The TV's own volume bar shows whenever a volume key reaches the
# system, and the firmware takes Settings before anything else can see it, so these keys get names that mean nothing to
# the system. Only the key helper answers them. Without the helper running they do nothing at all.
type OVERLAY

# Volume Up. 104 is the same button through the remote's infrared side.
map key 115 NUMPAD_RIGHT_PAREN
map key 104 NUMPAD_RIGHT_PAREN

# Volume Down.
map key 114 NUMPAD_LEFT_PAREN
map key 109 NUMPAD_LEFT_PAREN

# Mute.
map key 113 NUMPAD_EQUALS

# Settings: 357 through the Google remote service, 577 straight from the remote.
map key 357 NUMPAD_COMMA
map key 577 NUMPAD_COMMA
